orbit-tir 1
module fixture
function 0 everything string
block 0 0
instr 0 0 0 call string Item.all
instr 0 0 1 return unit v0
end-function 0
function 1 filtered string
param 1 0 p string
block 1 0
instr 1 0 0 load string p
instr 1 0 1 load string p
instr 1 0 2 call string Item.where v0 v1
instr 1 0 3 return unit v2
end-function 1
